{"title":"[精彩回顾]高峰总经理的主题演讲","date":"2017-06-26","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;\r\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">[</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">精彩回顾<span lang=\"EN-US\">]</span>高峰总经理的主题演讲<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:30.1pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">在这次研讨会上，四位企业负责人从不同的专业理念上，介绍其不同的研究、做法和经验，探索不同专业的项目管理发展之路，为项目管理的发展提供方向和指引。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">下面，让我们一起回顾广州易达建信科技开发有限公司高峰总经理的精彩演讲。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5825.JPG\" style=\"float: left;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent:32.15pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.15pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">优化企业内部治理<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.15pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">提升外部高端业务能力</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 28.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">探讨了在市场经济改革下，工程造价行业信息化的发展及必要性；工程造价的信息化重点就是数据为王；如何做好信息化，建立自己的内部资源；内修外治的重要分析；什么是国际化的全过程工程咨询；国际化形势下的差距分析与改变之道。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/DSC_0101_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"float: left;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5884.JPG\" style=\"float: left;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;\r\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体\">优化企业内部治理<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;\r\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体\">提升外部高端业务能力</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 28pt; margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t<b><sp